WEBVTT

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:13.290
Hurry!  Or their duel is going to start!

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:16.200
You sure we're going the right way?

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.980
Yes.  I'm following the horse's footprints.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.900
I must see this duel!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:48.070
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:55.210
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:01.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:07.860
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:15.230
With our memories fading

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:22.310
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:29.210
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:36.440
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:56.530 --> 00:02:02.200
Yugi vs Rafael
Impenetrable Guardian Deck

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:15.180
Otogi!  Step on it!

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:18.180
Yeah!  Or we'll never catch up to Yugi!

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.550
Okay!  Full speed ahead!

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:36.320
Hold on tight!

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:51.890
Hey, Otogi!

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:54.050
Don't leave us behind!

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:16.070
Rafael!

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:45.840
You're here.

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:51.080
Return Professor Hopkins, as promised!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.580
I already did.

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:57.320
He should be home by now.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.340
What?

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.770
There's no escape from our upcoming battle.

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:22.970
I'm honored, Yugi Muto.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:27.510
To duel you as a true duelist.

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.670
Don't make me laugh.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.970
You're a true duelist?

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:36.950
A true duelist would never use Duel Monsters for evil!

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:41.230
We're evil?  Then let me ask you, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.280
What's justice for you?

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.860
For me?

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:48.280
We believe in different things.

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.860
Believing in our own sense of justice.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:55.080
Is Doma's path evil or not?

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:58.610
That's for history to determine.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.480
History...

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:05.670
Yes.  And in this course of history, there's only one thing we can do.

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:12.490
For our own sense of justice, we can give all our strength in a duel.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:28.890
Duel!

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:34.820
What?

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:37.630
Be careful, my other self!

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.250
He's no ordinary duelist.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.750
I know, partner.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.850
I sense a menace...

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:49.480
It's as if a wild animal is staring at me.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.760
He's strong.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:56.000
I shall go first.  It's my turn!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.150
The Continuous Spell, Guardian Treasure!

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:04.780
By discarding five cards from my hand, I can draw two cards from my deck.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:08.140
And starting next turn, I draw two cards each turn.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:12.870
He discarded five cards just to strengthen his draw...

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:15.890
He wants The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.660
I summon a monster in defense position.

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:22.990
And I set a card and end my turn.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.000
I have no cards in my hand.

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:28.760
Feel safe now, Yugi?

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:32.100
I don't have The Seal of Orichalcos in my hand.

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:34.640
He has zero cards in his hand.

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:39.780
If I destroy his defending monster, I'll take the lead in this duel.

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:40.840
My turn!

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:44.280
Good!

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:49.590
I fuse Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts and Berfomet from my hand!

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:52.590
I summon Chimera the Flying Mythical Beast!

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:59.930
With Chimera's attack points, it can defeat ordinary monsters.

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:03.800
Go, Chimera!  Attack his defending monster!

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.600
Chimera Impact Dash!

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.210
What?

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:17.860
Backup Gardna has 2200 defense points.

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:20.670
Which is more than Chimera's attack points.

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:23.620
Regular attacks won't work.  Attack harder!

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:31.130
Again...

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.030
My turn.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:36.730
The Equip Spell, Gravity Axe - Grarl!

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:41.740
Gravity Axe's effect activates!

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.130
Come out, Guardian Grarl!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:50.850
Gravity Axe guides Guardian Grarl.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:57.420
Due to Backup Gardna's effect, the Equip Spell transfers to Guardian Grarl.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.590
3000 attack points!

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:01.820
Go, Guardian Grarl!

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:03.660
Decisive Slash!

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:11.620
He destroyed Chimera easily.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:14.880
Chimera's effect summons Berfomet!

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.880
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:24.080
That's not good enough to leave a scratch on my Guardian Deck.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.580
Guardian Deck?

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:30.600
Yes.  My monsters risk their lives protect me.

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:33.590
And I protect them.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:37.090
You protect your monsters?

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:53.340
The professor is sleeping well.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.140
And he's not hurt.

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.800
Anzu.  Look at this.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:00.760
I was searching the net for info.

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:03.950
What?  There's info about this on the net?

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:06.500
A news article from ten years ago.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.960
A luxury ship sank?

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:13.140
There was only one survivor.

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:15.460
I just remembered now.

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:23.830
When I became the American champion, I heard a rumor that I wasn't the #1 duelist.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:28.480
That there was a legendary guardian user who never appeared in public.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.160
And the guardian user's name was Rafael.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:33.950
So this boy is...

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.170
I'm certain!

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:36.740
Rebecca!

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:38.120
I want to go, Anzu!

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:40.050
Yugi will win.

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.020
Let's believe in him and wait.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.460
Anzu...

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:58.010
You can't comprehend how powerful the bond I have with these monsters.

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:00.470
You're so arrogant, Rafael.

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:05.610
Since the cards are their servants, all duelists trust their decks!

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:08.320
Yugi, look at this.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:14.060
He's used those cards until they're worn out.

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:20.160
I replaced the card backs so that these cards wouldn't be marked.

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:25.140
But it doesn't change the fact that these cards have supported me.

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:29.670
These cards brought me back from the edge of death.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:46.500
Yugi-  I mean, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.940
When I learned of your existence, I strangely felt pity for you.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:54.130
Because destiny played us both.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.860
Destiny played us?

00:10:57.160 --> 00:11:02.400
This place is similar to where my monsters and I lived together.

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:06.440
This place is like a deserted island, except on land.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.910
Here you go, brother!

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:25.860
What is it?

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.360
Open it!

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:33.320
Wow!  It's Guardian Eatos!

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:35.680
This is the card I wanted!

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:39.080
Julien and I looked all over for it!

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.170
Sonia!

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:45.330
Happy birthday, brother.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.610
Happy birthday!

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.920
Sonia, Julien.  Thank you!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.140
What's going on?

00:11:55.930 --> 00:11:56.920
Wait!

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:57.940
Wait!

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:04.940
Caught you!

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:06.810
Caught you too!

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.070
What's wrong?

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:10.170
Brother?

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.670
What's that?

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:25.550
Brother!

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:27.790
Brother!

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:30.480
Sonia!  Julien!

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:34.720
Brother!

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:37.260
Sonia!  Julien!

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.720
Papa!  Mama!

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:20.940
Sonia!  Julien!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:30.320
It happened so suddenly.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:34.390
Destiny took everything from me in an instant.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:55.330
Eatos, did you save me?

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:06.760
If I survived, maybe my family was alive too.

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:12.310
With this shred of hope, I vowed to survive on the remote island.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:22.270
Have you ever lived alone for three years, not talking or dealing with anyone?

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:55.060
The loneliness almost drove me insane.

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:59.840
But these cards helped me.

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:15.360
They're my friends and family.

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:17.590
His menacing aura...

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.670
Are his monsters protecting him?

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:30.710
Rafael!  If you love your cards, why do you support Doma?

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:34.460
You should know why, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:40.390
There's a destiny in this world that people cannot change.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.220
And I saw it!

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:39.000
A destiny that I couldn't even imagine.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:46.750
The boy who commands Duel Monsters...

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:52.390
Return to me when you learn everything.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:17:00.720
It was a miracle that I returned to this world.

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:09.370
But only despair awaited me.

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:11.740
My family was still missing.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:18.880
My relatives stole my father's inheritance and used me for publicity stunts.

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:26.310
Did I survive only to return to a world like this?

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:36.850
Nameless Pharaoh, why did your soul resurrect after thousands of years?

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:39.800
Why did my family have to die?

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:44.140
Why was I left in this savage world?

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:52.240
You have no answer.

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:58.680
There's only one way to answer destiny.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:16.960
Rafael, do you want to know why you're the only one who survived?

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:22.880
Then come.  I will guide you.

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:26.050
To learn the answer about destiny...

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:30.490
...you must accept destiny, no matter where it may lead.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:34.580
So you fight for your own destiny.

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:39.990
But our destiny says only one of us will survive.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:42.230
I have no intention of losing.

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:43.330
Neither do I.

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:52.140
Ouch!  I thought I was gonna die!

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:53.710
Hey, look!

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:55.570
Has the duel started?

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.050
My turn!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:01.750
The spell card, Five Star Twilight!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:10.590
I can activate Five Star Twilight when there's only a Level 5 monster on the field!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:16.580
The five stars summon the Kuriboh brothers!

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:20.210
I summon the five Kuriboh brothers!

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:26.070
So those monsters are going to protect you.

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:28.310
Don't let your guard down, Rafael.

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:31.310
Kuribah, activate your effect!

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:37.450
The five Kuriboh brothers merge to summon Kuribabylon!

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:42.650
Then I activate Pump Up from my hand!

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:47.730
This spell card doubles a monster's attack points for one turn!

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:51.600
Kuribabylon, attack Guardian Grarl!

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.910
I activate a spell card from the graveyard!

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:56.730
Rescuer from the Grave!

00:19:57.980 --> 00:20:00.740
A spell card that activates from the graveyard?

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:10.850
By banishing five cards from my graveyard, Rescuer from the Grave negates the battle.

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:14.820
I told you I would protect these monsters!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:18.500
He discarded his hand at the start to protect himself.

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:19.960
He truly is strong!

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:21.760
My turn!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.510
I'm a bit disappointed.

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:28.320
Our attack strengths were equal this last turn.

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:33.740
If you continued, your precious monsters would've been destroyed.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:41.250
Yugi, don't use your monsters so irresponsibly against me.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.250
I set two cards.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:48.940
The Continuous Spell, Purity of the Cemetery!

00:20:53.500 --> 00:21:02.090
Purity of the Cemetery deals you 100 points of damage every turn for each monster in your graveyard.

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:06.500
But this effect will vanish if I have a monster in my graveyard.

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:10.510
He won't put a single monster in his graveyard?

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:13.880
Let me tell you one more thing.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:18.620
I won't use The Seal of Orichalcos in this duel.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:23.730
I can defeat you without it.

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:28.860
By negating the battle, your little servants are still in attack position.

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:34.100
Guardian Grarl has 3000 attack points!

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.670
The difference is 2700 points.

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:39.950
This one strike will deal critical damage.

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:41.850
Go!  Guardian Grarl!

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:43.340
Decisive Slash!

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:08.380
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:16.790
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:27.880
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:37.400
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:46.430
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:51.940
I'll live feeling them

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:57.120
For me to be me

00:22:57.120 --> 00:23:05.580
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:06.260 --> 00:23:11.220
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:20.950
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:33.460
Each risking their sense of justice, Yugi and Rafael continue their intense battle.

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:40.360
Due to their strong bond, Rafael sacrifices his life points to protect his monsters.

00:23:40.360 --> 00:23:45.160
But is he really not going to use The Seal of Orichalcos?

00:23:45.160 --> 00:23:50.000
And Doma's true identity and mission are revealed?

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:52.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Truth About Doma

00:23:52.400 --> 00:23:53.970
Duel, standby!
